# Force LF line endings on every platform.
#
# The parser, formatting rules (DOC-7001/DOC-7002), and the byte-exact
# fixture contracts all assume LF. Without this file, git on Windows
# checks out text files with CRLF (core.autocrlf), which made the CLI
# report "file uses CRLF line endings" / "not formatted with 2-space
# indentation" on every fixture and broke 10 tests on windows-latest CI.
# Binary files are unaffected (text=auto only converts detected text).
* text=auto eol=lf
